1
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,210
总会三明治 汉堡包
Club sandwich, burger.

2
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:08,240
憨 干嘛笑得这么开心
Why the big smile, Han?

3
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:09,720
是在兴奋灯芯绒裤里没穿内裤吗
You going commando under those corduroys?

4
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,800
不 麦克斯 我开心是因为
No, Max, I am happy today because

5
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:15,740
用餐顾客的整体质素终于有了提高
diner clientele has finally changed for the better.

6
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:18,040
瞧 靠墙桌子那边
Look, two parties of cool hipsters

7
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:19,540
坐着两帮嬉皮士潮人
are sitting at tables near wall.

8
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,980
你觉得那边坐着的是六个嬉皮士吗
You think those are six hipsters?

9
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:25,820
好吧 咱们再考一遍
Okay, let's go over this one more time.

10
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:29,060
-如何区分嬉皮士和流浪汉 准备好了吗 -好了
- Hipster or homeless pop quiz, ready? - Ready.

11
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:30,680
-嬉皮士穿什么 -紧身牛仔裤
- Hipsters wear? - Skinny jeans.

12
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:32,460
-流浪汉穿什么 -脏牛仔裤
- Homeless wear? - Dirty jeans.

13
00:00:33,680 --> 00:00:35,540
-嬉皮士听什么 -收音机头的音乐
- Hipsters listen to? - Radiohead.

14
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:38,020
-流浪汉听什么 -自己头里的幻听
- Homeless listen to? - The voices in their head.

15
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:41,540
-嬉皮士有什么 -络腮胡和博客
- Hipsters have? - Beard and a blog.

16
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:44,520
-流浪汉有什么 -络腮胡和愁云惨雾
- Homeless have? - Beard and so much sadness.

17
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:47,400
我看见愁云笼罩着他和他
I see sadness, there and there.

18
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:49,000
我来搞定
I'll handle this.

19
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:52,620
我说过这家店不欢迎你们这种人
I told you before, I don't want you kind in here.

20
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:53,820
滚去追逐潮流吧
Take a trendy hike.

21
00:00:54,760 --> 00:00:57,926
赶紧动身 苹果店十点就关门了
Better step it up. The Apple store closes at ten.

22
00:01:00,020 --> 00:01:01,780
麦克斯 为什么你要把嬉皮士赶走
Max, why did you kick out the hipsters?

23
00:01:02,360 --> 00:01:03,520
因为我不想再次成为
'Cause I could not be in the background

24
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:05,000
他们非主流自拍的人肉背景
of another Instagram photo.

25
00:01:18,860 --> 00:01:19,820
这是最后一张账单 厄尔
Here's the last check, Earl.

26
00:01:20,420 --> 00:01:22,500
麦克斯 那桌客人小费给得小气
And, Max, they stiffed us on the tip

27
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:23,800
却大方地忘了他们的相机
but they forgot their camera.

28
00:01:24,240 --> 00:01:25,360
我会把它交给奥列格
Oh, I'll give it to Oleg.

29
00:01:25,460 --> 00:01:27,300
他可以拍一张他的"独家"照片
He can take one of his special pictures.

30
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:30,280
这样的话 等他们回来取相机时
That way, when they come back to get it,

31
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:32,060
就能赏他们点小"鸡"瞧瞧
everyone will have been stiffed.

32
00:01:33,180 --> 00:01:34,780
晚安 女士们
Well, good night, ladies.

33
00:01:34,880 --> 00:01:36,980
我得在下雪之前到家
I gotta get home before the snow starts.

34
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:39,300
不会下雪的啦 厄尔 现在有十度呢
It's not gonna snow, Earl, it's 50 degrees.

35
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:41,260
肯定会下雪 相信我
Oh, it's gonna snow, trust me.

36
00:01:41,360 --> 00:01:43,500
我猜不准我前妻何时会找上门
I couldn't tell when my first wife was coming,

37
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:45,620
但暴风雪上门 我可是一个说一个准
but I can sure tell when a storm is coming.

38
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:51,540
好吧 计划是什么
All right, so what's the plan?

39
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:53,420
如果真的下雪 我们该怎么办
What are we gonna do if it does snow?

40
00:01:53,660 --> 00:01:55,480
你个死白妞 白雪遍地时我会弄丢你的
You're so white, I'm worried we're gonna lose you.

41
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:58,160
我喜欢下雪天
I love the snow.

42
00:01:58,300 --> 00:02:00,760
打开我的阳台门 看着雪花飘落
Opening my balcony doors and watching it fall

43
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:02,360
就像全新的白色亚麻布
like fresh white linen and then

44
00:02:02,360 --> 00:02:05,200
然后跑到对街的公园堆雪天使
running across the street to the park to make snow angels.

45
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:07,200
没错 那是你有钱时的下雪天
Yeah, that's snow when you're rich.

46
00:02:08,340 --> 00:02:10,260
今年你唯一能看见的雪"天使"
The only snow angels you'll see this year

47
00:02:10,260 --> 00:02:12,560
是六个在门廊前冻成冰的瘾君子
are the six crack addicts frozen to our stoop.

48
00:02:13,980 --> 00:02:16,480
更不用说那只被我们非法
Oh, not to mention the adorable frozen horse

49
00:02:16,480 --> 00:02:18,120
养在后院的可爱冰棍马
we have illegally living in the backyard.

50
00:02:18,420 --> 00:02:20,540
麦克斯 不要这么夸张 栗宝没事的
Max, don't overreact. Chestnut's fine.

51
00:02:20,580 --> 00:02:21,720
离下雪还几周时间呢
It's not gonna snow for weeks.

52
00:02:21,898 --> 00:02:23,020
好吧 你就这么想吧
All right, have it your way.

53
00:02:23,020 --> 00:02:24,140
但我可不想下一位房客
But I wouldn't want to be the next tenants

54
00:02:24,660 --> 00:02:26,220
搞不懂为什么会有愤怒的马魂
who have to figure out why a pissed off horse

55
00:02:26,220 --> 00:02:27,680
在布鲁克林的公寓阴魂不散
is haunting a Brooklyn apartment.

56
00:02:29,260 --> 00:02:32,340
我冷死了 她却自以为是天气"砖"家
I was cold and she thought she knew weather patterns.

57
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:37,320
奥列格 存张你鸡鸡的倩影到这相机里吧
Oleg, take a picture of your junk on this customer's camera.

58
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:37,940
收到
Done.

59
00:02:39,719 --> 00:02:41,100
你不问原因吗
Aren't you gonna ask why?

60
00:02:41,100 --> 00:02:41,660
你有求 我必硬
No need.

61
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,660
我刚看见奥列格的...
I just saw Oleg's...

62
00:02:50,020 --> 00:02:51,200
我得负部分责任
Yeah, that might have been my fault.

63
00:02:52,460 --> 00:02:54,400
第一次见到 你震惊是正常的
Kind of a shock seeing it for the first time.

64
00:02:57,140 --> 00:02:58,620
麦克斯 我不喜欢你暗示
Max, I don't like you implying

65
00:02:58,620 --> 00:03:00,480
我可能会做出虐待栗宝的事
that I would ever be cruel to Chestnut.

66
00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:01,820
我没有在暗示
I'm not implying it.

67
00:03:01,820 --> 00:03:02,920
我是明示
I'm saying it outright.

68
00:03:04,440 --> 00:03:05,320
现在可是冬天
It's winter.

69
00:03:05,620 --> 00:03:07,760
我又不是没考虑过这个问题
And it's not like I've not been thinking about it.

70
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:09,500
但栗宝需要一个特别的家
But Chestnut belongs in a special home.

71
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:10,720
你才需要一个特别的家吧[精神病院]
You belong in a special home.

72
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:13,740
我查过了
I've done some research,

73
00:03:13,740 --> 00:03:15,420
在大山峰公园有间休养所
and I found a retreat in the Grand Tetons

74
00:03:15,420 --> 00:03:17,440
刚离婚的女人会去那里拥抱马儿
where newly-divorced women come to hug horses

75
00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:19,300
帮助她们重建信任的能力
to help them gain back their ability to trust.

76
00:03:19,300 --> 00:03:23,180
栗宝唯一相信的 是我这对"大山蜂"
The only Grand Tetons Chestnut trusts are mine.

77
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:27,272
小妞 赶紧面对现实吧
Lady, you gotta get a reality check real quick

78
00:03:27,272 --> 00:03:29,140
厄尔说会下雪就真的会下
'cause Earl thinks it's gonna snow.

79
00:03:29,140 --> 00:03:31,400
厄尔还觉得《黑街神探》的主题曲
Earl also thinks the theme from Shaft

80
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:34,220
是剽窃他在1975年寄出的录音样本呢
was stolen from a cassette tape he sent out in 1975.

81
00:03:35,740 --> 00:03:37,460
把嘴闭上 真有其事
Shut your mouth. That happened.

82
00:03:37,860 --> 00:03:40,240
麦克斯 不会下雪的
Max, it's not gonna snow.

83
00:03:40,380 --> 00:03:41,300
我懂雪
I know snow.

84
00:03:41,380 --> 00:03:43,520
我家在瑞士的萨斯费拥有一座小木屋
We owned a ski chalet in Saas-Fee Switzerland

85
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:45,420
这家餐馆也没人比我更了解
and I think I know more than anyone in this restaurant

86
00:03:45,420 --> 00:03:46,560
如何在寒冷的气候下生存
about living in cold climes.

87
00:03:52,340 --> 00:03:53,600
要下雪啦
Snow is coming.

88
00:03:55,100 --> 00:03:57,640
喂 瑞士小妞 你想跟雪列格先生
Yo, Swiss miss, you wanna have a conversation about cold climes

89
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:58,700
聊聊寒冷的气候吗
with Snowleg over there?

90
00:03:59,420 --> 00:04:01,400
麦克斯 我差点忘记了
Oh, Max, I almost forgot.

91
00:04:01,660 --> 00:04:02,460
相机还你
The camera.

92
00:04:03,500 --> 00:04:05,180
我想你一定会很满意
I think you'll be very pleased.

93
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:08,380
我还附赠了个精彩小短片哟
I made a little video as well.

94
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:11,900
为什么你要穿两件大衣啊
Why are you wearing two coats?

95
00:04:12,100 --> 00:04:13,680
跟我戴两个套子一个道理
Same reason I wear two condoms.

96
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:14,660
免得有层破了
In case one breaks.

97
00:04:21,260 --> 00:04:22,220
搞毛呀
What the?

98
00:04:27,220 --> 00:04:29,220
早安 全世界最烂的天气预报员
Well, good morning, world's worst weather girl.

99
00:04:29,660 --> 00:04:31,700
我这辈子没见过阳光如此"充足"的一天
I have never seen so much sunshine.

100
00:04:33,980 --> 00:04:35,240
你知道这意味着什么吗
You know what that means?

101
00:04:35,440 --> 00:04:36,700
《黑街神探》主题曲的确是厄尔写的
Earl wrote Shaft.

102
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:40,280
麦克斯 我知道下雪了 不劳你提醒
Max, I know it snowed, you don't have to tell me.

103
00:04:40,420 --> 00:04:42,860
被这么多的白色包围 感觉就像阿尔·帕西诺
I'm surrounded by so much white stuff I'm like Al Pacino

104
00:04:42,860 --> 00:04:44,220
在《疤面煞星》里的最后一幕
in the last scene of Scarface.

105
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:46,900
你穿的是什么呀
What are you wearing?

106
00:04:46,900 --> 00:04:50,100
看起来像长出俩手臂的疯狂垃圾袋
You look like a bag of crazy garbage grew arms.

107
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:52,940
这是2011年冬季家用品混搭系列
It's the Hefty 2011 winter collection.

108
00:04:53,420 --> 00:04:54,480
我把大衣给栗宝了
I gave Chestnut my coat.

109
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:56,260
这是让雪不落在我身上的唯一办法
This is the only way to keep the snow off me.

110
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,700
瞧瞧可怜的栗宝
Look at poor Chestnut.

111
00:04:59,740 --> 00:05:00,880
他蹄子裹的是什么
What is he wearing on his hooves?

112
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:02,840
我把我名牌山羊绒的袜裤剪了给它穿
I cut up my Fendi cashmere leggings.

113
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:04,260
上次我们潜入别墅时顺手抓的
I grabbed them when we raided the town house.

114
00:05:04,740 --> 00:05:06,380
我当时只想着自己 忘了他了
I thought ahead for me, but not for him.

115
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:09,259
让他穿女人衣服 他尊严何在啊
He is humiliated in those ladies clothes.

116
00:05:09,259 --> 00:05:11,869
他看起来像埃德加·胡佛
He looks like J. Edgar Hoover.

117
00:05:11,880 --> 00:05:13,860
我凌晨四点就出来扫雪了
I've been out here sweeping since 4:00 A.M.

118
00:05:13,860 --> 00:05:15,940
但雪一直下
But it just keeps coming down.

119
00:05:15,940 --> 00:05:17,600
你他妈有病啊 雪花
What is your problem, snow?

120
00:05:17,660 --> 00:05:18,980
我以前多爱你呀
I used to love you!

121
00:05:20,780 --> 00:05:22,640
或许我们该问问你以前的门童
Maybe we should ask your old doorman

122
00:05:22,640 --> 00:05:25,380
"这里插入统称的爱尔兰人名" 来帮忙
"insert generic Irish name here" to come help.

123
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:27,160
我知道他们的名字
I know their names.

124
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:29,020
日班詹姆斯 夜班詹姆斯和黑人詹姆斯
Day James, night James and black James.

125
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:32,920
你的计划就是一直扫雪扫到开春
So your plan is you're gonna sweep the snow away till spring

126
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:34,840
扫到他被雪活埋了还在扫吗
while the horse is trapped under this tarp?

127
00:05:34,840 --> 00:05:36,800
而且这块防水布是附近那家
Which I'm pretty sure was covering the out of business

128
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:38,200
倒闭的古巴饭馆的顶盖吧
Cuban restaurant down the street.

129
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:40,460
他们倒闭了 我留了张纸条
They were out of business and I left a note.

130
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:43,280
上面写什么 "我是疯子 多谢"
What did it say? "I'm loco, gracias."

131
00:05:43,780 --> 00:05:46,580
不 我是写"抱歉拿了你屋顶 撑着点"
No, it said, "Sorry I took your roof, hang in there.:

132
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:49,820
麦克斯 不要这么消极
Max, don't be so negative.

133
00:05:50,440 --> 00:05:52,120
管这布是哪儿来的 管用就行了
Doesn't matter where it came from, it's working.

134
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:55,360
我再固定一下这块布就行了
I just need to secure this tarp a little.

135
00:05:56,220 --> 00:05:58,260
打住 你是想蹬着高跟鞋
Stop, you were gonna climb on an icy chair

136
00:05:58,260 --> 00:05:59,980
爬上结冰的椅子 然后摔断脖子吗
in six inch heels and break your neck

137
00:06:00,200 --> 00:06:01,720
然后害我得养着穿袜裤的马
and then I'm gonna be stuck with a horse in leggings

138
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:03,940
和嘴里叼着筷子坐轮椅的你
and you in a wheelchair with a chopstick in your mouth

139
00:06:03,940 --> 00:06:06,220
还用筷子打信号 "抱歉 我以为能行的"
tapping out, "I'm sorry, I thought that would work."

140
00:06:07,140 --> 00:06:08,860
我在博爱居家当义工时
I learned to build when I volunteered

141
00:06:08,860 --> 00:06:10,200
学过盖东西
with Habitat for Humanity.

142
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:13,380
回想起来 那些穷人比现在的我富多了
Looking back, they had so much more than I have now.

143
00:06:15,300 --> 00:06:15,740
好吧
Okay.

144
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:18,660
我得去当保姆了
I gotta go to my babysitting job

145
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:21,500
等我回来 你和我得坐下来
and when I get back, you and I are gonna sit down

146
00:06:21,500 --> 00:06:23,460
好好商量出一个靠谱点的家
and come up with a more realistic home

147
00:06:23,460 --> 00:06:24,060
给小变装癖马
for J. Edgar Hoofer.

148
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:26,280
麦克斯 他就住在这儿
Max, he lives here.

149
00:06:26,280 --> 00:06:27,960
相信我 这行的
And I'm telling you, this is working.

150
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:30,440
我这法子其实蛮聪明的呢
What I'm doing is actually kind of brilliant.

151
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:38,200
现在我开始担心你盖的那些房子了
Now I'm worried about those houses you built.

152
00:06:44,260 --> 00:06:45,140
你好 琵琪
Hey, Peach.

153
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:48,320
麦克斯 我有个天大的好消息
Max, I have the most incredible news.

154
00:06:48,740 --> 00:06:50,720
律师终于发现婚前协议书的漏洞了吗
Lawyer finally found a loophole in your prenup?

155
00:06:51,700 --> 00:06:53,280
我也希望 但不是
I wish, no.

156
00:06:53,860 --> 00:06:55,280
我刚接到电邮通知
I just got an email

157
00:06:55,380 --> 00:06:57,040
我成功晋级到
and I have made it to the final round

158
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,960
《三角洲主妇》选角的最后一轮了
of casting for Real Housewives of Tribeca.

159
00:07:00,980 --> 00:07:02,540
《三角洲主妇》啊
Real Housewives of Tribeca?

160
00:07:02,860 --> 00:07:03,920
现在连普通小区都能成为主题了吗
They're doing neighborhoods now?

161
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:06,600
那之后是要做《这里到那里主妇》吗
What's next, Real Housewives of from here to there?

162
00:07:09,260 --> 00:07:10,660
布莱德和安洁莉娜
and I want everything to be perfect

163
00:07:10,660 --> 00:07:12,120
得呈现最完美的一面给人家看
when they see Brad and Angelina.

164
00:07:13,260 --> 00:07:15,460
琵琪 你不觉得你的孩子
Uh, Peach, are you aware that your children

165
00:07:15,460 --> 00:07:16,740
被衣服包得喘不上气吗
are being eaten by clothing?

166
00:07:19,840 --> 00:07:21,620
这个儿童防雪服可是国际大牌呀
The snowsuits are Burberry.

167
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:24,060
而且包起来就看不出安洁莉娜的肥胖
And the padding hides Angelina's weight problem.

168
00:07:24,220 --> 00:07:26,480
够了 你别再这么说了
Okay, you have to stop saying that.

169
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:27,700
她才没有体重问题
She doesn't have a weight problem.

170
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:30,560
她一年胖了11公斤呢
She's gained 25 pounds in one year.

171
00:07:32,940 --> 00:07:35,140
没错 因为她的体重是从0开始
Yeah, 'cause she started at zero.

172
00:07:37,140 --> 00:07:39,800
麦克斯 我们必须得呈现最好的一面 因为
Max, we all have to look our best, 'cause ready?

173
00:07:39,900 --> 00:07:43,800
这节目还是我和米斯提·马斯特鲍的较量
The last spot in the show is between me and Misty Mastbaum.

174
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:45,840
我以为她是你闺蜜呢
I thought she was your bestie.

175
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:48,200
她是啊 但我的闺蜜是贱人
She is, but my bestie's a bitchy.

176
00:07:49,700 --> 00:07:51,440
她超级好胜
She's crazy competitive.

177
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:53,920
节目刚有谱
As soon as we were approached about the show,

178
00:07:53,980 --> 00:07:56,980
她就领养了三条腿的狗 还取名为泡菜
she adopted a three-legged corgi and named it Mr. Pickle.

179
00:07:58,180 --> 00:07:59,600
那还真是很超级贱啊
That's crazy bitchy.

180
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:03,360
所以现在 我要找残疾的动物
So now, I'm looking up handicapped animals

181
00:08:05,460 --> 00:08:07,460
你想要只残疾的动物吗
Oh, you want a handicapped animal?

182
00:08:07,900 --> 00:08:09,720
我可以帮你弄来
I got your handicapped animal.

183
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:14,140
我知道一匹有分辨性别障碍的流浪马
I know a homeless horse with gender identity issues.

184
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:18,300
我是想要一些可爱点 但有缺陷的
I was thinking something cute, but damaged.

185
00:08:18,540 --> 00:08:20,040
比如法国独眼斗牛犬
Like a one-eyed French bulldog.

186
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:24,100
要是这匹马以前是匹明星马呢
What if I told you that this horse was a celebrity horse?

187
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:25,980
继续说
Tell me more.

188
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:28,640
我朋友 卡洛琳·钱宁
My friend, Caroline Channing...

189
00:08:28,700 --> 00:08:29,960
你怎么会认识卡洛琳·钱宁啊
How do you know Caroline Channing?

190
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:33,040
她是我戒酒互助协会的保证人
She's my AA sponsor.

191
00:08:34,180 --> 00:08:35,420
的确有可能
Makes sense.

192
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:37,740
继续
Go on.

193
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:42,040
总之 这匹可爱但是超有缺陷的马是她的
Anyway, she has this cute, but crazy damaged horse

194
00:08:42,040 --> 00:08:44,060
她的生活从天堂掉下地狱后
and since her life flipped upside down,

195
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:45,000
那马需要一个好的归属
he needs a good home.

196
00:08:45,980 --> 00:08:48,040
我得先见见卡洛琳·钱宁
Well, I'd have to meet Caroline first.

197
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:50,060
周六把她带这儿来
Bring her by on Saturday.

198
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:54,380
麦克斯 这个主意太棒了
Max, what an amazing idea.

199
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:56,720
米斯提就乖乖受死吧
Misty is literally going to die.

200
00:08:58,680 --> 00:09:01,580
我真高兴你酗酒过度
I am so thrilled you have a drinking problem.

201
00:09:10,040 --> 00:09:11,860
你非得把他放我卧室吗
Did you have to put him in my bedroom?

202
00:09:12,520 --> 00:09:14,040
你房间最容易布置"马匹保护措施"
It was the easiest room to horse proof.

203
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:15,380
毕竟里面没值钱物品
You have so little of worth.

204
00:09:17,380 --> 00:09:19,000
你不用在谷歌上搜了 我已经
You can stop googling. I already found

205
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,400
找到完美的下家了
a perfectly good place to put him.

206
00:09:20,780 --> 00:09:23,580
你不会想着让我把栗宝交给琵琪吧
You're not still suggesting I give Chestnut to Peach Landis?

207
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:26,920
麦克斯 看着我 看着我的眼睛
Max, look at me. Look at me in the eyes.

208
00:09:27,500 --> 00:09:28,220
你嗑药嗑傻了吗
Are you high?

209
00:09:29,820 --> 00:09:31,660
没有 你乱弄我房里的东西后
No, I couldn't find my bedroom stash

210
00:09:31,660 --> 00:09:33,040
我就找不到我的"药"了
since you moved everything around.

211
00:09:33,700 --> 00:09:35,260
栗宝需要的是一个有爱的家
Chestnut needs a home with affection

212
00:09:35,300 --> 00:09:36,860
琵琪连抱自己的孩子都不愿意
and Peach won't even hug her children.

213
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:37,940
她雇你来代劳
She pays you to do that.

214
00:09:38,060 --> 00:09:39,180
所以才完美呀
That's why it's perfect.

215
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:40,880
华丽的马房她出钱
She'll pay for the fancy stable

216
00:09:40,880 --> 00:09:43,260
我们还可以随心所欲地去抱栗宝
and we'll go and hug Chestnut for her whenever we want.

217
00:09:43,540 --> 00:09:45,180
你只需去见她一面 然后这事就成了
You just need to go meet her and it's done.

218
00:09:45,600 --> 00:09:47,380
我是天生的富家女
I have the DNA of a rich girl,

219
00:09:47,500 --> 00:09:49,300
即使我现在和你躺在廉价公寓的床上
even though I'm lying in bed with you in a tenement

220
00:09:49,380 --> 00:09:50,940
还用了硬币去买晚餐
and I bought my dinner tonight with dimes.

221
00:09:51,760 --> 00:09:53,160
我和栗宝是老派富人
Chestnut and I are old money.

222
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:55,140
老派富翁不会到处炫耀自己
And old money doesn't parade itself around

223
00:09:55,140 --> 00:09:56,960
在摄像机前显摆求关注
in front of cameras and beg for attention.

224
00:09:57,100 --> 00:09:58,700
不光你有老钱
Hey, you're not the only one with old money.

225
00:09:58,700 --> 00:09:59,940
我口袋里也有个
I've had a dollar in my jeans

226
00:09:59,940 --> 00:10:01,460
揣了三周的老硬币
I've been carrying around for three weeks.

227
00:10:02,660 --> 00:10:03,600
你周六去见琵琪
You're meeting Peach Saturday,

228
00:10:03,700 --> 00:10:05,020
我们就跟那匹马说再见了
and we're saying good-bye to the horse.

229
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:07,880
送走栗宝对你来说就这么容易啊
Why is getting rid of Chestnut so easy for you?

230
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:10,020
难道你小时候没养过宠物吗
Didn't you ever have a pet as a child?

231
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:11,560
养过 我有只小狗
Yes, I had a puppy.

232
00:10:11,860 --> 00:10:13,360
跟我妈妈住了一周后
And after a week of living with my mom,

233
00:10:13,540 --> 00:10:15,920
她就开车把我跟小狗都扔路边了
she pulled the car over and put us out on the side of the road.

234
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,220
她把狗弄走了啊
She got rid of it?

235
00:10:18,340 --> 00:10:20,300
听着 宠物不是我的菜
Look, pets are not my thing, okay?

236
00:10:20,340 --> 00:10:22,060
我已经有个又黏人又毛绒绒
I already have something needy and fluffy

237
00:10:22,060 --> 00:10:24,000
不照顾就会死掉的东西 就是你
that'll die if I don't take care of it... you.

238
00:10:26,260 --> 00:10:28,180
快去 到你去看他了
Go, it's your turn to go check on him.

239
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:30,520
不要 上次我过去 抓到他偷吃我胸罩呢
No, I went the last time and caught him eating my bra.

240
00:10:31,260 --> 00:10:33,300
别夸大其词 他只吃了一半
Don't exaggerate. He only ate half of it.

241
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:35,680
抱歉 你说得对 我应该持乐观态度
Oh, I'm sorry, you're right, I should be more positive.

242
00:10:35,920 --> 00:10:37,580
我的罩"杯"是半满的
One of my cups is half full.

243
00:10:41,880 --> 00:10:43,000
里面发生什么事了
What's going on in there?

244
00:10:44,020 --> 00:10:45,620
我想你应该不会
I don't suppose there's any way

245
00:10:45,620 --> 00:10:47,740
在梳妆台上拉一大坨屎吧
you took a giant dump on your dresser?

246
00:10:49,940 --> 00:10:51,740
你不能怪栗宝 他可能是不安
You can't blame Chestnut. He's probably nervous.

247
00:10:52,060 --> 00:10:53,080
穿上你的袜裤之后
After wearing your leggings,

248
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:54,980
他一直准备着一举成名的试镜呢
he's getting ready for his fame audition.

249
00:10:56,140 --> 00:10:59,820
他是个疯子 从手到脚都是
He's a maniac, maniac on all fours.

250
00:11:01,100 --> 00:11:02,580
麦克斯 有发现
Oh, Max, here's something.

251
00:11:02,740 --> 00:11:04,840
布鲁克林的艾薇马房
The Ivy bridge riding stables in Brooklyn.

252
00:11:04,940 --> 00:11:06,360
离这儿只有五英里远
Only five miles away.

253
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:08,300
他们的网站上说 他们的马
It says on their website that their horses

254
00:11:08,300 --> 00:11:10,240
能在广告和电影中出镜
are featured in commercials and films!

255
00:11:10,460 --> 00:11:13,620
栗宝说不定能出演《战马》续集呢
Can you say Chestnut, star of the War Horse sequel?

256
00:11:14,800 --> 00:11:17,100
你是不是偷抽了我床头柜的大麻
Did you take the weed from my bedside table?

257
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:18,540
看着我
Look at me.

258
00:11:18,580 --> 00:11:19,660
看着我的眼睛
Look at me in the eyes.

259
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:21,340
你嗑药嗑傻了吗
Are you high?

260
00:11:22,800 --> 00:11:23,320
老实说
Honestly...

261
00:11:24,460 --> 00:11:25,100
有点儿
a little.

262
00:11:26,700 --> 00:11:27,580
关掉电脑 快睡觉吧
Close that and go to sleep.

263
00:11:27,800 --> 00:11:28,760
不 我还在看
No, I'm still reading.

264
00:11:29,780 --> 00:11:32,500
瞧 我刚弄出了你的浏览记录
Oh look at that, I just pulled down your browser history.

265
00:11:32,740 --> 00:11:33,680
挺耐人寻味啊
Interesting list.

266
00:11:34,020 --> 00:11:35,060
小猫弹电子琴
Kitten plays a keyboard,

267
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:37,720
小猫边打喷嚏边放屁
kitten sneezes and farts at the same time?

268
00:11:37,800 --> 00:11:39,080
给我 那可是我的隐私
Give me that, that's private.

269
00:11:39,180 --> 00:11:40,700
小猫折衣服
Kitten folds a T-shirt!

270
00:11:41,140 --> 00:11:42,720
小猫按门铃
Oh, kitten rings a doorbell.

271
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:44,720
我还以为宠物不是你的菜呢
I thought you said you weren't into pets.

272
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:45,640
我是不喜欢
I'm not!

273
00:11:46,060 --> 00:11:48,360
但这可是小猫按门铃啊
It's a kitten ringing a doorbell!

274
00:11:49,300 --> 00:11:52,260
他想用人类的方式进门
He's trying to get in like people.

275
00:11:53,460 --> 00:11:55,660
你对可爱动物明明就没有抵抗力
You have a secret soft spot for animals.

276
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:57,760
不 我只喜欢奇怪的小猫
No, I'm just into freaky kittens.

277
00:11:58,580 --> 00:12:00,400
还有个影片是小猫穿上蛇皮西装
There's one who puts on a snakeskin suit

278
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:02,060
然后去出差呢
and goes on a business trip.

279
00:12:02,580 --> 00:12:04,920
这不是可爱 这是奇怪
That's not soft. That is freaky.

280
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:08,320
好吧 你让我去帮栗宝找个现实的下家
Fine, you're telling me to get a reality check about Chestnut.

281
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:09,400
但你也需要回到现实
But you need one too.

282
00:12:09,860 --> 00:12:11,260
他走后你一定会想他的
You're gonna miss him when he's gone.

283
00:12:12,740 --> 00:12:13,660
麦克斯 你有在听吗
Max, are you listening?

284
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:19,260
麦克斯 别担心
Max, don't worry.

285
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:20,780
我知道明天去马房
I know it's all gonna work out perfectly

286
00:12:20,780 --> 00:12:21,820
绝对会进展顺利
at the stables tomorrow.

287
00:12:22,060 --> 00:12:22,600
我没有在担心
I'm not worried.

288
00:12:35,020 --> 00:12:36,460
那人还没来呢
The man's not here yet.

289
00:12:36,660 --> 00:12:38,560
靠 转回去 我们得重新进场
Damn it, turn us around Max, we have to enter again.

290
00:12:38,660 --> 00:12:39,920
这都是第三遍了
This is the third time.

291
00:12:40,460 --> 00:12:42,640
拜托嘛 麦克斯 跟奥列格借大衣
Max, come on, we borrowed these coats from Oleg

292
00:12:42,640 --> 00:12:44,440
不就是为了巨星般的入场吗
to make a dramatic star entrance.

293
00:12:44,580 --> 00:12:45,620
如果你想让我再假[高潮]一次
If you want me to fake it again,

294
00:12:45,700 --> 00:12:47,280
你得请我吃饭 叫我美人儿
you have to buy me dinner and call me pretty.

295
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,880
好吧 那快帮忙放我下来
Fine, then help me down quickly.

296
00:12:50,040 --> 00:12:52,900
我不想下马的丑样被马房的人撞见
I don't wanna be mid-dismount when the stable guy walks in.

297
00:12:57,477 --> 00:12:59,208
天啊
God, ugh.

298
00:12:59,558 --> 00:13:01,300
你刚坐到我脸上了
You just sat on my face.

299
00:13:01,300 --> 00:13:02,840
好像我还没有"受"够一样
Like I haven't done enough for you.

300
00:13:04,660 --> 00:13:06,460
你好 请问你是汤尼吗
Oh, hello, are you Tony?

301
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:08,060
没记错的话 我是
Last time I checked.

302
00:13:08,340 --> 00:13:08,960
天啊
Oh, jeez.

303
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:11,780
我是卡洛琳·钱宁 我们通过电话
I'm Caroline Channing. We spoke on the phone.

304
00:13:11,900 --> 00:13:13,640
他是栗宝
And this is Chestnut.

305
00:13:13,640 --> 00:13:14,800
麦克斯 往后退
Max, step back.

306
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:16,680
很好 我就去那边
Oh, great. I'll just be over here

307
00:13:16,720 --> 00:13:18,280
跟《桂冠幼童》节目背景里
like the awkward father in the background

308
00:13:18,280 --> 00:13:19,440
尴尬的父亲一样站着
on Toddlers and Tiaras.

309
00:13:20,460 --> 00:13:21,620
主角在这儿
Well, here he is.

310
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:24,300
我们谈过的 栗宝是只冠军跳栏马
And as we discussed, Chestnut is a champion jumper

311
00:13:24,500 --> 00:13:25,940
他的马术表演无懈可击
his dressage is impeccable,

312
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:27,920
他在马术表演赛上得过三次奖
he's ribboned three times at the Hampton Classic,

313
00:13:27,920 --> 00:13:30,520
血统来自十分精英荟萃
and he comes from a historically elite line

314
00:13:30,520 --> 00:13:31,620
的表演马家族
of distinguished show horses.

315
00:13:31,920 --> 00:13:33,800
他尿起尿来跟镇暴水柱一样威猛
And he pees like a civil rights fire hose.

316
00:13:34,620 --> 00:13:35,900
麦克斯 再往后退退
Max, step further back.

317
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:37,600
得了 咱们就打开天窗说亮话吧
Come on, let's cut to the chase.

318
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:41,060
他是匹好马 棕色 穿袜裤的样子超恶心
He's nice, brown, he looks sick in leggings,

319
00:13:41,060 --> 00:13:43,980
他还不要钱 要不要随便你
and he's free, so take him or leave him.

320
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:45,500
你说他是什么时候的跳栏马
When'd you say he was a jumper?

321
00:13:45,980 --> 00:13:47,960
2005至2010年
From 2005 to 2010.

322
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:49,580
他以前可是有专人指导的呢
He was in a class by himself.

323
00:13:49,920 --> 00:13:51,620
或许他过去是个跳栏马
Well, maybe he was a jumper,

324
00:13:51,620 --> 00:13:53,160
但他已经廉颇老矣了
but he isn't anymore.

325
00:13:53,580 --> 00:13:53,940
什么
What?

326
00:13:54,340 --> 00:13:55,500
他身材有点走样了
Well, he's a little out of shape.

327
00:13:55,900 --> 00:13:56,860
你丫的有种啊
Well, you have a gut.

328
00:13:58,380 --> 00:14:00,720
别激动 我只是说他曾勇猛过
Whoa! I'm just saying he's seen better days.

329
00:14:00,780 --> 00:14:02,960
我也只是说你曾不秃过
I'm just saying your hair is falling out in fistfuls.

330
00:14:03,580 --> 00:14:04,520
好了 好了
Okay, okay.

331
00:14:04,560 --> 00:14:06,820
别搞人身攻击 这生意还得谈呢
Let's not get personal, we all want this to work.

332
00:14:06,900 --> 00:14:07,980
他这么说栗宝
He's the one who's getting personal

333
00:14:07,980 --> 00:14:09,400
才是人身攻击吧
going after Chestnut like that.

334
00:14:09,400 --> 00:14:11,180
好吧 那你告诉我
Okay, you tell me,

335
00:14:11,220 --> 00:14:12,560
他上一次运动是什么时候
when's the last time he's exercised?

336
00:14:12,660 --> 00:14:14,060
你上一次运动又是什么时候
When's the last time you exercised?

337
00:14:15,060 --> 00:14:16,880
看来娱乐界不好混呀
Wow, show business is rough.

338
00:14:17,760 --> 00:14:19,360
好了 你是汤尼 对吧
All right, it's Tony, right?

339
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:20,520
没记错的话 是的
Last time I checked.

340
00:14:21,020 --> 00:14:22,800
汤尼 你必须得原谅她
All right, Tony, you'll have to forgive her.

341
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:25,100
她真的很爱这匹马 并希望这能谈成
She really loves him and wants this to work out.

342
00:14:26,040 --> 00:14:27,920
重点是 天下没有免费的马
Bottom line is, even a free horse isn't free.

343
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:30,620
养他要钱 照顾费神
I still have to feed him and take care of him

344
00:14:30,980 --> 00:14:33,260
而老实说 这匹马给我赚不来一个子儿
and truth be told, this horse isn't gonna make me a penny.

345
00:14:33,540 --> 00:14:36,260
电影合作商过来 肯定也是选那匹靓马
If my film guy comes in here, he's gonna pick that beauty

346
00:14:36,260 --> 00:14:37,440
而不是这匹
over this one.

347
00:14:40,080 --> 00:14:41,460
所以这事谈不成 姑娘们
So it's not gonna work out, girls.

348
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:44,960
好吧 你不要还有别人要呢 死胖子
All right, well, we got other offers, fatty.

349
00:14:45,560 --> 00:14:47,060
来 咱们走
Come on, let's go.

350
00:14:50,060 --> 00:14:52,800
下次你害人穿着借来的有毒
You know, maybe next time before you let someone

351
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:56,084
又带廉价古龙水味的皮毛大衣
ride five Miles across Brooklyn in a toxic, Russian,

352
00:14:56,084 --> 00:14:57,480
骑了五英里穿过布鲁克林时
cologne-soaked rent-a-fur,

353
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:59,640
你应该搞搞清楚 电影业
you should be clear that the film business,

354
00:14:59,680 --> 00:15:02,220
即使选马 也偏爱有年纪跟精英血统的
even for horses, is ageist and elitist.

355
00:15:02,800 --> 00:15:05,000
没错 我们的确是走下坡的老将
And, yes, we may have seen better days,

356
00:15:05,060 --> 00:15:07,700
但只要努力与决心和一点点运气
but with hard work, determination and a little luck,

357
00:15:07,700 --> 00:15:09,220
谁说老将就不能再上巅峰
one day we'll be back on top.

358
00:15:09,400 --> 00:15:12,160
对了 你的大明星马根本就无聊到爆
Yeah, and I'm not impressed by your big star pony overthere.

359
00:15:13,480 --> 00:15:14,340
只会傻站着一动不动
He's just standing still.

360
00:15:14,460 --> 00:15:15,094
要想打动我的心
You wanna impress me?

361
00:15:15,094 --> 00:15:17,780
让他学猫叫 然后去按门铃吧
Have him meow and ring the doorbell.

362
00:15:20,400 --> 00:15:22,100
别放在心上 栗宝
Don't take it personally, Chestnut.

363
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:23,820
那些马都是整形的
Those horses have had work done.

364
00:15:30,840 --> 00:15:33,800
在见琵琪之前 把垃圾袋肚兜脱了如何
Maybe you wanna take the cinch sack off before you meet Peach.

365
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:36,640
不必 外面在下雪 而我还是个穷光蛋
No, it's snowing again and I'm a penniless beggar.

366
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:37,720
那就应该打扮得像点
I should look like one.

367
00:15:37,820 --> 00:15:39,360
再说了 她可能会以为这是时尚打扮呢
Besides, she'll probably think it's a look.

368
00:15:39,980 --> 00:15:41,400
好吧 我知道跟琵琪见面
All right, I know this one on one

369
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:42,880
不是你理想中的场景
with Peach isn't your ideal scenario,

370
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:44,100
但一切都是为了栗宝
but it's what's best for Chestnut,

371
00:15:44,180 --> 00:15:45,740
所以打起精神 面对现实吧
so man up and face reality.

372
00:15:46,600 --> 00:15:47,400
你说得对
You're right.

373
00:15:49,100 --> 00:15:51,600
我的朋友 卡洛琳·钱宁
And my friend, Caroline Channing...

374
00:15:53,440 --> 00:15:54,560
怎么了
What is it?

375
00:15:54,860 --> 00:15:56,460
你可能已经做好准备面对现实
You might be ready to face reality,

376
00:15:56,520 --> 00:15:58,320
但你准备好要面对现实版的真人秀了吗
but are you ready to face reality TV?

377
00:15:58,880 --> 00:16:00,480
这地方充斥着琵琪版的克隆人
The place is crawling with Peach clones

378
00:16:00,480 --> 00:16:02,000
和准备拍你的电视摄像机
and TV cameras ready to meet you.

379
00:16:02,020 --> 00:16:03,160
她完全是挖坑给咱们跳
She totally set us up.

380
00:16:03,160 --> 00:16:04,280
你开什么玩笑
Are you kidding me?

381
00:16:04,980 --> 00:16:07,320
太妙了 这太棒了 真是太棒了
Fabulous, this is awesome, just awesome.

382
00:16:07,440 --> 00:16:09,120
她利用卡洛琳·钱宁的潦倒奇葩样
She's using the Caroline Channing freak show

383
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:10,700
来让她进另一个奇葩秀
to get herself on another freak show.

384
00:16:10,840 --> 00:16:12,699
好吧 你说得对 咱们走 你不必进去
All right, you're right, let's go, you don't have to do this.

385
00:16:12,699 --> 00:16:15,300
不 如果栗宝因我得游街示众
No, if I made Chestnut parade around

386
00:16:15,300 --> 00:16:16,880
在电视上被人当笑话看
and be humiliated in public,

387
00:16:16,880 --> 00:16:18,520
我也愿意接受同样的待遇
then I have to be willing to do the same.

388
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:20,220
给 拿着我的"大衣"
Here, hold my coat.

389
00:16:22,900 --> 00:16:24,460
你一直随身带着这些吗
You always have those with you?

390
00:16:24,600 --> 00:16:25,880
是啊 我可是从曼哈顿来的
Yes, I'm from Manhattan.

391
00:16:28,740 --> 00:16:31,020
-好了 说"感谢您大驾光临" -什么
- Okay, thank me for coming. - What?

392
00:16:31,560 --> 00:16:33,420
感谢您大驾光临 当我还是亿万富翁的时候
Thank me for coming, that's what people did all the time

393
00:16:33,420 --> 00:16:34,140
别人常对我说
when I was a billionaire.

394
00:16:35,360 --> 00:16:36,300
感谢您大驾光临
Thank you for coming.

395
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:39,900
不 感谢您邀请我
No, thank you for inviting me.

396
00:16:41,680 --> 00:16:43,000
哇 太牛了
Wow, that's so cool.

397
00:16:44,920 --> 00:16:46,140
淡定点
Don't freak out.

398
00:16:46,540 --> 00:16:48,100
我要一秒钟变富家女了
I'm about to get my rich on.

399
00:16:49,660 --> 00:16:51,300
我们进去后 我需要介绍你吗
So when we go in there I'll introduce you?

400
00:16:51,580 --> 00:16:52,360
不必
Oh, you don't have to.

401
00:16:52,500 --> 00:16:53,420
有钱人总是假装
Rich people always pretend

402
00:16:53,420 --> 00:16:54,060
认识彼此
to know each other.

403
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:55,600
现在打开门
Now open that door,

404
00:16:55,600 --> 00:16:57,120
让我帮栗宝找个家
and let's get my baby a home.

405
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:02,040
琵琪
Peach.

406
00:17:02,660 --> 00:17:06,000
我想感谢你邀请我来你这么漂亮的家
I wanna thank you for inviting me into your beautiful home

407
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:07,900
在我这非常困难艰苦的时期
and showing me such kindness

408
00:17:07,900 --> 00:17:10,740
对我伸出援手
during this very difficult, difficult time.

409
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:15,060
女士们 我正式向大家介绍
Ladies, I would like you all to meet

410
00:17:15,060 --> 00:17:17,780
我亲爱的朋友 卡洛琳·钱宁
my dear friend, Caroline Channing.

411
00:17:18,200 --> 00:17:22,260
在她经济上非常困难艰苦的时期
Who, in light of her recent very difficult, difficult

412
00:17:22,260 --> 00:17:27,380
她请我收养她残疾的宠物马
financial troubles, has asked me to adopt her damaged pet horse

413
00:17:28,020 --> 00:17:32,360
这还是我的酒鬼仆人麦克斯帮牵的线
who was brought to my attention by my alcoholic servant, Max.

414
00:17:33,480 --> 00:17:35,320
她在那边
Right over there.

415
00:17:39,080 --> 00:17:39,840
卡洛琳
Caroline,

416
00:17:40,700 --> 00:17:41,900
感谢您大驾光临
thank you for coming.

417
00:17:42,100 --> 00:17:44,780
不 感谢你的邀请
No, thank you for inviting me.

418
00:17:45,980 --> 00:17:47,120
我为你感到骄傲
I'm proud of you.

419
00:17:47,500 --> 00:17:49,420
是我为你感到骄傲
No, I'm proud of you.

420
00:17:50,220 --> 00:17:51,980
搞得我又浑身起鸡皮了
I just got the chills again.

421
00:17:56,400 --> 00:17:58,160
麦克斯 你瞧他
Oh, Max, look at him.

422
00:17:58,180 --> 00:17:59,260
他在笑呢
He's smiling.

423
00:17:59,700 --> 00:18:01,080
他喜欢这地方
He likes this place.

424
00:18:01,520 --> 00:18:04,340
是啊 也快值得你在真人秀上被人羞辱了
Yeah, it's almost worth you being humiliated on reality TV.

425
00:18:04,840 --> 00:18:06,000
我不会出现在那节目上的
Oh, I'll never be on that show.

426
00:18:06,120 --> 00:18:07,100
我没有签授权书
I didn't sign the release.

427
00:18:07,740 --> 00:18:08,060
什么
What?

428
00:18:08,720 --> 00:18:09,900
老派富人不会随便签名
Old money don't sign.

429
00:18:11,760 --> 00:18:13,560
你会喜欢这儿的 对吧
You're gonna love it here, huh?

430
00:18:14,020 --> 00:18:15,440
你是不是会喜欢这呀
Aren't you gonna love it here?

431
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:16,840
又好又大的马房
A nice big stable.

432
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:19,920
我可能喜欢 也可能不喜欢
Maybe I will, maybe I won't.

433
00:18:21,060 --> 00:18:24,620
也许我该跟我的挚友麦克斯回家住
Maybe I should come home and live with my best friend, Max.

434
00:18:25,140 --> 00:18:26,420
那卡洛琳怎么办
What about Caroline?

435
00:18:26,840 --> 00:18:28,940
她可以睡在防水布下
She can sleep under the tarp.

436
00:18:29,820 --> 00:18:31,680
我猜你找到你的大麻了
So I guess you found your weed.

437
00:18:33,160 --> 00:18:35,600
不 我和栗宝单独相处时 都这么玩
No, this is just something we do when we're alone together.

438
00:18:35,760 --> 00:18:36,600
这是我们的小秘密
It's kind of our thing.

439
00:18:37,780 --> 00:18:39,780
你真的很爱栗宝 对吧
You really love Chestnut, don't you?

440
00:18:40,680 --> 00:18:41,700
还好啦
He's all right.

441
00:18:41,700 --> 00:18:42,480
他又不是猫咪
He's no kitten.

442
00:18:44,400 --> 00:18:47,260
好吧 我们很快会再见的 栗宝
Okay, I'll see you soon, Chestnut.

443
00:18:49,440 --> 00:18:50,280
你想单独跟他待会儿吗
You want a minute alone?

444
00:18:51,280 --> 00:18:52,500
我在外面等你
I'll be out front.

445
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:02,720
我知道这些话可能有点可笑
This is probably gonna seem ridiculous to you

446
00:19:02,720 --> 00:19:04,840
因为你只是匹马 而我只是某个
because you're a horse and I'm just some lady

447
00:19:04,840 --> 00:19:07,380
在过去几个月一直喂你胡萝卜的女人
that's been slipping you carrots for the last few months, but...

448
00:19:08,880 --> 00:19:11,080
我真的爱上你了
I really got attached to you.

449
00:19:11,960 --> 00:19:14,400
这待遇可是其他马儿没有的
This is way more than most horses get out of me.

450
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:19,220
罐装巧克力豆停产那会儿 我都没这么难过
I wasn't even this upset when they discontinued tan M&Ms.

451
00:19:21,580 --> 00:19:22,569
我...
I, um...

452
00:19:24,840 --> 00:19:27,540
我这一生有许许多多的不如意
I really haven't had much go right for me in my life,

453
00:19:27,540 --> 00:19:29,980
我也确信未来只会愈加艰难
and I'm pretty sure things are gonna keep getting worse but,

454
00:19:29,980 --> 00:19:31,660
可你却如此的好
you were a good thing.

455
00:19:33,040 --> 00:19:34,540
当一切都不如人意时
And when everything sucked,

456
00:19:34,760 --> 00:19:36,460
你是我们生活中唯一的美好
you were the best thing we had going.

457
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:39,220
而且你还毛绒绒的
And you're fuzzy too.

458
00:19:40,820 --> 00:19:43,020
你超毛茸茸的 而且谁敢说
You're so fuzzy, and no one can argue

459
00:19:43,020 --> 00:19:45,860
摸着一个暖融融毛绒绒的东西不有爱啊
that touching a warm, fuzzy thing isn't straight up lovely.

460
00:19:47,140 --> 00:19:50,080
感谢你给我们带来的一切
So, thank you for everything you did for us, but...

461
00:19:51,080 --> 00:19:52,560
尤其是长得这么毛绒绒
especially for being fuzzy.

462
00:19:58,120 --> 00:19:59,200
麦克斯 你还好吧
Max, are you okay?

463
00:20:00,080 --> 00:20:01,840
嗯 我没事 我绝不会有事
Yeah, I'm fine, I'll always be fine.

464
00:20:02,260 --> 00:20:03,160
你在哭吗
Are you crying?

465
00:20:04,020 --> 00:20:05,000
是的 我在哭
Yeah, I'm crying,

466
00:20:05,120 --> 00:20:06,420
因为我也想住在这里
'cause I wish I could live here.

467
00:20:12,600 --> 00:20:14,360
别担心 我们可以来看他
Don't worry, we'll come visit,

468
00:20:14,360 --> 00:20:16,460
我们会想到法子 等春天来了就带他回家
and we'll find a way to bring him home in the spring.

469
00:20:17,280 --> 00:20:19,480
好啦 我有满满一口袋铜板呢
Come on. I have a pocket full of dimes.

470
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:22,360
我们去买点便利店玉米卷
Let's go get some convenience store taquitos

471
00:20:22,360 --> 00:20:24,720
配着蓝覆盆子酒 大快朵颐一番吧
and wash 'em down with blue raspberry wine coolers.

472
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:26,060
杂货店在特卖呢
They're on sale at the bodega.

473
00:20:26,560 --> 00:20:28,440
八瓶只要五块
Two four packs for five dollars.

474
00:20:29,380 --> 00:20:32,760
你还真懂怎么让伤心的姐妹打起精神
You know exactly what to say to cheer a broke sista up.

475
00:20:34,560 --> 00:20:36,020
等回到家 给你看个小猫
And when we get home, I found a video

476
00:20:36,020 --> 00:20:37,520
他会唱火星哥的歌呢
of a kitten singing Bruno Mars.
